<title>JAPAN: Matsushita-Kotobuki shares leap on rosy earnings.</title>
<headline>Matsushita-Kotobuki shares leap on rosy earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Matsushita-Kotobuki Electronics Industries Ltd leapt in early morning Thursday trade, brokers said, propelled by rosy interim earnings.</p>
<p>As of 0110 GMT, the shares were 120 yen higher at 2,800 yen.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the video equipment producer said its parent current profit for the six months to September 30, 1996, was 11.52 billion yen against 3.15 billion yen in the previous year.</p>
